OL,3,AFourteen killed in strike on Myanmar
OL,4,Amonastery
OL,5,
OL,6,FCivilians had reportedly gathered at
OL,7,Fthe site for a meditation retreat to
OL,8,Fmark Buddhist Lent. Myanmar's military
OL,9,Fhas not commented.
